<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to our platform!</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      color: #333333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      padding: 40px 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .header p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a2e;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .message {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #555555;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .features {
      background: #f8f9ff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .features h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #333;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .feature-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
    }
    .feature-icon {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      background: #667eea;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-right: 10px;
      color: white;
      font-size: 11px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: block;
      width: fit-content;
      margin: 32px auto;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: #eef0f3;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 24px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888888;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #667eea;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome Aboard! 🎉</h1>
      <p>Your account is ready to go</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>

      <p class="message">
        We're thrilled to have you join us! Your account has been successfully created and is ready to use.
        You can now access all the features our platform has to offer.
      </p>

      <div class="features">
        <h3>What you can do now:</h3>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <span class="feature-icon">✓</span>
          Manage your profile and account settings
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <span class="feature-icon">✓</span>
          Access all platform features and resources
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <span class="feature-icon">✓</span>
          Collaborate and connect with others
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <span class="feature-icon">✓</span>
          Secure JWT-based authentication
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="cta-button">Get Started →</a>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p class="message" style="font-size: 14px;">
        If you did not create this account, please ignore this email or
        <a href="{{appUrl}}/contact" style="color: #667eea;">contact us</a> immediately.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        You received this email because you registered at <a href="{{appUrl}}">our platform</a>.<br />
        Registered email: <strong>{{email}}</strong>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">© {{year}} All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
